# nexora-action-code: get_stp
Value Filldown,Required INSTANCE (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value Required ROLE (\S+)
Value Required STATE (\S+)
Value COST (\d+)
Value PORT_PRIORITY (\d+)
Value OPER_EDGE (True|False)
Value TYPE (.+?)

Start
  ^\s*MST\s+${INSTANCE}\s+vlans\s+map\s*:.*$$
  ^\s*Interface\s+Role\s+Sts\s+Cost\s+Prio\s+OperEdge\s+Type\s*$$ -> Rows

Rows
  ^\s*MST\s+${INSTANCE}\s+vlans\s+map\s*:.*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${ROLE}\s+${STATE}\s+${COST}\s+${PORT_PRIORITY}\s+${OPER_EDGE}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
